    <string name="about_title">About Scanner Doc</string>
    <string name="about_desc">Scanner Doc turns your phone into a precise document scanner. Scan several pages in a row, fine-tune the corners with a magnifier, set the exact output size in millimeters or centimeters, pick a filter and resolution, then export as PDF, JPG or PNG and send it to any app or save it to your phone.</string>
    <string name="about_features_title">Features</string>
    <string name="about_features">• Live document edge detection\n• Multi-page scanning into a single PDF\n• Exact physical size (mm / cm) and DPI\n• Filters: original, enhanced color, grayscale, black &amp; white\n• Rotate, mirror and magnifier-assisted corner adjustment\n• Send to WhatsApp, Telegram, Bale, Drive, Gmail and more</string>
    <string name="about_privacy">Your documents are processed on your device only. Nothing is uploaded unless you choose to send a file yourself.</string>
    <string name="about_libs">Built with Jetpack Compose, CameraX and OpenCV.</string>
